{
  "comment": "The Angler: where each Angler Command Lab parameter lives in the game. key = the lab's own key (the SHIPPED block in Docs/Studios/AnglerCommandLab.html); asset + field = the Unity field it becomes. AnglerConfig.asset rows use AnglerConfigSO's own field names (each the lab's key, its tooltip the lab's label). 'cruise' is the Angler.prefab transformer's DefaultThrottleScaler (cruise = MinimumSpeed 0 + ThrottleScaler at full throttle). Not mapped, and listed by --unmapped: boost (the game stores it as MaxBoostMultiplier = boost / cruise, which author_angler_assets.py writes and checks), turnRate (the lab's flight is a stand-in; the hull turns by the Stoat's two-stick scalers), the game's own creature numbers (claw*/quad*/tad*/lf*, read FROM the game's assets, never written back), the cell (cellR, nucleusR, dietAny), urgency (commanded creatures run at the cell's own aggression), the lab-only schemes (paint/flare/gaze/lasso/sling/feral knobs, which no longer ship) and the lab's missions and AI (taskClear, taskTimeout, rookie*, aiErase). Edit this file, never the assets by hand.",
